{"about_the_game":"Chinese Culinary Shop is a simulation game centered around traditional Chinese cuisine. In the game, you play as a uniquely talented Chinese head chef, personally experiencing the process of making authentic Chinese dishes. Step by step, transform your humble inn into a renowned culinary paradise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a15455140c1f6a19f6e10a165f88c636.avif?t=1769401735\" width=620 height=76 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a567af0b1cc3dab6c6c9f769cd05450a.poster.avif?t=1769401735\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a567af0b1cc3dab6c6c9f769cd05450a.webm?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a567af0b1cc3dab6c6c9f769cd05450a.mp4?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Chinese Culinary Shop, you'll have the chance to handcraft a wide variety of traditional Chinese delicacies, such as West Lake Vinegar Fish, Guobaorou (Sweet and Sour Pork), and various rare mushrooms. Through simulated actions like chopping, stir-frying, and controlling the heat, experience the transformations of dozens of unlockable ingredients during cooking, imparting unique flavors to every dish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/64dc06186608d96619b0f030e95a609e.avif?t=1769401735\" width=620 height=76 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/073295f9370c1394fe4e874a4408bd5f.poster.avif?t=1769401735\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/073295f9370c1394fe4e874a4408bd5f.webm?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/073295f9370c1394fe4e874a4408bd5f.mp4?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Chinese Culinary Shop , let's rediscover the art of cooking and seasoning traditional Chinese cuisine in a whole new way. No more puzzling over whether to add a &quot;suitable amount&quot; or just &quot;a little bit&quot; of seasoning. Treat every dish as a precious creation, allowing common ingredients to shine with newfound brilliance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/cdbcb7742f9819d3b1621442bc5dbe49.avif?t=1769401735\" width=620 height=76 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/0a396339afb1b70ccd7178fbc7017fb1.poster.avif?t=1769401735\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/0a396339afb1b70ccd7178fbc7017fb1.webm?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/0a396339afb1b70ccd7178fbc7017fb1.mp4?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You'll have the opportunity to trace the history of Chinese gastronomy and explore the unique culinary arts of imperial court banquets. In Chinese Culinary Shop, unlock the secret recipes of imperial chefs. Learn to create dishes like &quot;Dragon and Phoenix Affection&quot; from the Manhan Banquet menu, or the Su-style &quot;Cherry Pork&quot; recorded in ancient texts... Unlock countless classic traditional recipes. These dishes are not only mouthwatering but also carry profound cultural heritage.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554990?t=1769401735","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554990?t=1769401735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/9cedc357ca8c75350f23d0e71502733fd8a67c49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769401735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/9cedc357ca8c75350f23d0e71502733fd8a67c49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769401735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3885470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Chinese Culinary Shop is a simulation game centered around traditional Chinese cuisine. In the game, you play as a uniquely talented Chinese head chef, personally experiencing the process of making authentic Chinese dishes. Step by step, transform your humble inn into a renowned culinary paradise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a15455140c1f6a19f6e10a165f88c636.avif?t=1769401735\" width=620 height=76 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a567af0b1cc3dab6c6c9f769cd05450a.poster.avif?t=1769401735\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554990/extras/a567af0b1cc3dab6c6c9f769cd05450a.webm?t=1769401735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_